Cultissima: {
	DisplayName: Nerd

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: Yes, I'm alright, thanks for asking.
		NoHome: How am I supposed to make myself cozy when I have no room of my own?
		FarFromHome: I'm too unfamiliar with this place to find my way home alone.
		LoveSpace: Peace and quiet, just how I like it.
		DislikeCrowded: It's getting a bit full around here.
		HateCrowded: Too many people too close to my bubble.
		LoveBiome: Sitting inside a nice warm cabin and watching the snowfall outside, there is no better feeling.
		LikeBiome: You know, reading a nice book on the beach during sunset is such a relaxing thing to do. Very enjoyable.
		DislikeBiome: Caves are just so lonely and creepy, it's not very nice. At least it's quiet I guess.
		HateBiome: When my friend said that those pixies are noisy, I didn't think they could be that bad. They ARE. In fact. That bad.
		LoveNPC: "{NPCName} is a really nice gal, she'd always compliment my hair and help me brush it. If I ever need a redo of my colors, I'll ask her."
		LikeNPC: I would be dead if it wasn't for Avaeris and his companions. He even gave me a place to stay, he is pretty alright.
		DislikeNPC: This mushroom kid that hangs around here is getting on my nerves. He just keeps making mushroom jokes and disturbs my reading sessions.
		HateNPC: What is actually wrong with {NPCName}? He gave me some weird hallucinogenics to help with my headaches, saying it's natural medicine. NEVER again.
		LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is pretty cultured I must say. It's fun hanging out and having deep conversations."
		Princess_LovesNPC: Cultissima and I are often sitting together eating cookies. Her immense knowledge is actually very cool.
	}
}
